model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "A Worker's metadata hash covers each binding's data without the dev-only `hyperdrives` channel a Hyperdrive binding contributes beside the wire binding, which only local development reads and the upload never carries: its origins come from the Hyperdrive's attributes, which an apply takes from what it reconciled and a later plan from the live read, so hashing them planned every Worker bound to a Hyperdrive as an update on every deploy. A change to the wire binding itself still changes the hash. The change rides in the pinned Alchemy release's dependency patch, so an Alchemy upgrade carries it forward or retires it explicitly."
    }
  }
}
